# Sports Betting Service — API playground
#
# Run these with the "REST Client" extension (VS Code / Cursor) or JetBrains'
# built-in HTTP client. Click "Send Request" above each request.
#
# Prereqs:
#   npm run docker:up && npm run prisma:migrate && npm run db:seed && npm run start:dev
#
# Seeded casino groups: `acme` (basketball, baseball, NFL, soccer) and `betzone` (basketball only).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5003
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@group = acme
# Paste an operator launch token from: npm run dev:token -- --merchant acme-merchant
@operatorToken = PASTE_OPERATOR_TOKEN_HERE

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Auth (Phase 3a): launch → session token
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Exchange an operator launch token for a player session token
# @name launch
GET {{api}}/launch?token={{operatorToken}}

### Authenticated request using the session token (chained from launch)
GET {{api}}/sports
Authorization: Bearer {{launch.response.body.sessionToken}}

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Health & metadata (no tenant header required)
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Readiness (Postgres + Redis)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready

### Service metadata
GET {{api}}

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Catalog (Phase 1) — tenant-scoped
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Sports offered to the group
# @name sports
GET {{api}}/sports
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### Leagues for the group
# @name leagues
GET {{api}}/leagues
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### Leagues filtered by the first sport (chained from the sports response)
GET {{api}}/leagues?sportId={{sports.response.body.$[0].id}}
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Fixtures / schedule (Phase 1) — tenant-scoped, paginated
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### First page of fixtures
GET {{api}}/fixtures?page=1&pageSize=5
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### Fixtures filtered by status
GET {{api}}/fixtures?status=SCHEDULED&pageSize=10
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Events, markets & odds (Phase 2) — tenant-scoped
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Live events for the group
# @name liveEvents
GET {{api}}/events/live
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### Event detail (first live event, chained)
GET {{api}}/events/{{liveEvents.response.body.$[0].id}}
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### Markets + selections with odds (first live event, chained)
# @name markets
GET {{api}}/events/{{liveEvents.response.body.$[0].id}}/markets
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### Single market by id (chained from the markets response)
GET {{api}}/markets/{{markets.response.body.$[0].id}}
X-Casino-Group: {{group}}

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Tenant scoping & guardrails
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Missing tenant header -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{api}}/events/live

### Unknown / inactive group -> 403 Forbidden
GET {{api}}/events/live
X-Casino-Group: does-not-exist

### betzone sees only basketball (no soccer fixtures) — compare with acme above
GET {{api}}/events/live
X-Casino-Group: betzone

### Cross-tenant block: betzone requesting a soccer-only event -> 404
### 1) As acme, list live events and copy a soccer event id (ARS/CHE/LIV/MCI/RMA/FCB).
### 2) Paste it below and run as betzone.
GET {{api}}/events/PASTE_NBA_EVENT_ID_HERE
X-Casino-Group: betzone

### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Betting (Phase 4) — requires session token from launch above
### ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@idempotencyKey = bet-{{$timestamp}}

# @name placeBet
### Place a single-selection bet (paste a selection id from markets response)
POST {{api}}/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{launch.response.body.sessionToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "selectionIds": ["PASTE_SELECTION_ID_HERE"],
  "stake": "10.00"
}

### List my bets
GET {{api}}/bets
Authorization: Bearer {{launch.response.body.sessionToken}}

### Bet detail (chained from place bet)
GET {{api}}/bets/{{placeBet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{launch.response.body.sessionToken}}
